Unicorns *always* catch any item of the 'gem' class (which includes
rocks and grey stones) that enters their square as a player-thrown
projectile, and either accept them (with various possible effects on
your luck), or discard them in disgust.

It should be noted that you can use this as a 100% reliable way of
determining which gems are glass, without preventing you from extracting
a few zorkmids from shopkeepers with them.
